[list]
[*] Adjustment in the material of the external lanterns of the ASIAN HOME theme;
[*] Implementation of the system to close the windows and doors before descending the walls in ASIAN HOME;
[*] Addition of fire sound on the plane crashed in the WW2 theme;
[*] Correct some hierarchy problems in the MERRY CHRISTMAS theme;
[*] Solution the problem of the pieces side panel that in some situations, the pieces were not visible and required the player to use the mouse wheel to lower them;
[*] In the MAC version, the problem of the boxes appearing with the wrong background in some situations has been solved;
[*] Correction of minor errors;
[*] Improved performance.
[/list]
Wait for the launch of another theme soon.

